  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the given input voltage waveform&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mtext>in&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math> the output voltage waveform&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math> across the capacitor is correctly depicted by :</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0095_bc976825b496.png\" style=\"width: 390px; height: 160px;\" />&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>"
  },
